    "title": "BloomChic | A Re-Imagining",
    "description": "BloomChic is a digital-first fashion brand focused on re-imagining the options for women sizes 10-30. Founded in 2021, it exists to empower mid- and plus-size women worldwide through unprecedented access to style, comfort, and choice. \r\n\r\nDownload the app and enjoy:\r\n- An additional 20% off your first in-app order\r\n- Free shipping on all orders over $69\r\n- Easy Returns within 30 days of receiving your package\r\n- Up to 300+ new styles every day \r\n- Easy access to our reward-rich loyalty program \r\n- PayPal, credit cards, Apple Pay, and Google Pay accepted \r\n- 24/7 live chat with Customer Support",
